A||||5||GWMORGAN||Best Exhaust Manifold Gasket?||||5
Z||000000||GWMORGAN||11-07-1999||06:19 PM||||Which exhaust manifold gasket is the best and where can I purchase these? Any experience? 86GT.    Thanks for info.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Eric||11-07-1999||06:46 PM||||I'm going to put Fel-Pro on my manifolds.  I've heard they're the best out there and I don't have any reason to think why the exhaust manifold gaskets won't be the same.  They are silver with metal rings around the port and the centers connecting them are made out of some sort of high temp material.  Should be good!||||reg||1
Z||000002||Eric||11-07-1999||06:49 PM||||I got my gaskets at Advance Auto Parts, but any popular chain should be able to get them for you.  I did, however, order mine in a complete rebuild set, so you may have to hunt around a little more than I did.  Good luck!||||reg||1
Z||000003||GWMORGAN||11-07-1999||08:36 PM||||Thanx for info.....Have you guys ever heard of a gasket made from copper??? I saw this somewhere sometime ago, but can't remember where.||||reg||1
Z||000004||fieroshop||11-07-1999||10:16 PM||||To be frank, the only gaskets we use here at the Fiero Shop are FelPro. I've had exceptionaly good results with FelPro that I don't use anything else.||||reg||10
Z||000005||lowCG||11-08-1999||12:18 AM||||GM #10051512 is good.||||reg||1
